<title>JAPAN: Japan Dec domestic WPI falls 0.5 pct yr/yr--BOJ.</title>
<headline>Japan Dec domestic WPI falls 0.5 pct yr/yr--BOJ.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1996-01-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>Japan's domestic wholesale price index, a key component of the overall WPI, was down 0.5 percent in December from a year earlier, but up 0.2 percent from November, the Bank of Japan (BOJ) said on Thursday.  </p>
<p>The following is a breakdown of the December WPI:</p>
<p>Year-on-year change (percent)</p>
<p>	    December    November</p>
<p> Overall   +0.9	  +0.5</p>
<p> Domestic  -0.5	  -0.6</p>
<p> Exports   +3.3	  +2.4</p>
<p> Imports  +12.9	 +11.4</p>
<p>Month-on-month change (percent, index base year 1990):</p>
<p>	    December    November Index</p>
<p> Overall   +0.3	  +0.3    93.4</p>
<p> Domestic  +0.2	  +0.1    95.3</p>
<p> Exports   +0.5	  -0.2    86.4</p>
<p> Imports   +1.4	  +2.3    85.0</p>
</text>
